OL,4,CThe 'estate agent' listing park        
OL,5,Cbenches as homes                       
OL,6,GA homelessness charity has opened a    
OL,7,Gmock estate agent's office with        
OL,8,Glistings such as underpasses and park  
OL,9,Gbenches rather than properties.        
OL,11,F"Wrongmove" has opened in two empty    
OL,12,Fshops in Sheffield city centre as part 
OL,13,Fof a new campaign by the Archer        
OL,14,FProject to highlight rough sleeping    
OL,15,Fduring the winter.                     
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
