OL,4,CCamera records 400 speeding vehicles   
OL,5,Cin six weeks                           
OL,6,GMore than 400 vehicles have been       
OL,7,Grecorded speeding through a Yorkshire  
OL,8,Gvillage in the six weeks since a new   
OL,9,Groadside camera was installed.         
OL,11,FThe AutoSpeedWatch camera captures     
OL,12,Fdetails of vehicles travelling above   
OL,13,Fthe 30mph (48km/h) limit on the A166   
OL,14,Fthrough Wetwang.                       
OL,16,FUnlike traditional speed enforcement   
OL,17,Fcameras, being caught does not         
OL,18,Fautomatically result in a fine.        
OL,19,FInstead, the information can be used   
OL,20,Fby police to send warning letters to   
OL,21,Fmotorists and identify repeat          
OL,22,Foffenders.                        G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
