OL,4,CIce rink and lights launch Christmas   
OL,5,Cfestival                               
OL,6,GThree days of festive activities       
OL,7,Gincluding live music, a pantomime and  
OL,8,Gan ice rink will get under way in      
OL,9,GBoston today.                          
OL,11,FThe town's Christmas Festival, which   
OL,12,Fwill run until Sunday, will open at    
OL,13,F14:00 GMT followed by entertainment    
OL,14,Fand the lights switch-on at 18:45.     
OL,16,FThere will be a festive market on      
OL,17,FSaturday and Sunday, as well as        
OL,18,Ffurther entertainment.                 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
